This is Anthropic, Read Aloud. Today: Claude Marketplace: one place to discover plugins, agents, and services from our partners.

2
00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:17.600
Claude Marketplace: one place to discover plugins, agents, and services from our partners.

3
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:30.097
The Claude Marketplace brings plugins, connectors, agents, and service partners into one place. Find the tools and services to do more with Claude, or list what you've built to reach teams using Claude.

4
00:00:30.547 --> 00:00:34.851
From Claude Blog, published September 23, 2026.

5
00:00:35.851 --> 00:00:54.022
Starting today, the Claude Marketplace brings plugins and connectors, agents and products, and service partners into one place. For customers, it provides a single destination to find the right tools and services. For builders and partners, it offers an easier way to reach teams using Claude.

6
00:00:54.822 --> 00:00:59.092
For customers: discover tools and services to help you do more with Claude.

7
00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:04.985
The Claude Marketplace is where teams find what they need to expand how they use Claude. You can:

8
00:01:05.435 --> 00:01:14.873
Add connectors and plugins. Choose from more than 2000 available today, including Atlassian, Google, Microsoft, Notion, Salesforce, and more.

9
00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:26.608
Buy agents and products. Use a portion of your committed Anthropic spend on Claude-powered software from companies like CrowdStrike, Cursor, Harvey, Legora, Lovable, and Snowflake.

10
00:01:26.848 --> 00:01:41.779
Scale with service partners. Connect with a consulting partner or system integrator from the Claude Partner Network, such as Accenture, Boston Consulting Group, or Deloitte, to build your A I strategy and roll Claude out across your organization.

11
00:01:42.579 --> 00:01:46.550
For builders and partners: get discovered by teams using Claude.

12
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:56.201
Companies that build tools, products, or services for Claude customers can be listed in the Claude Marketplace. Pick the path that fits what you offer:

13
00:01:56.651 --> 00:02:08.246
Building for teams that use Claude? Create a connector or plugin using the Model Context Protocol (M C P) and Agent Skills, the open standards pioneered by Anthropic.

14
00:02:08.486 --> 00:02:17.656
Selling a Claude-powered agent or product? Apply to list it on the marketplace. Teams can then use a portion of their committed Anthropic spend to buy it.

15
00:02:17.896 --> 00:02:27.413
Offering consulting or systems integration? Join the Claude Partner Network to appear in the marketplace, where Claude customers can find and connect with you.

16
00:02:28.413 --> 00:02:48.212
That was Claude Marketplace: one place to discover plugins, agents, and services from our partners, from Claude Blog, published September 23, 2026. Read the original at claude dot com. This unofficial audio edition was generated automatically for the podcast Anthropic, Read Aloud.
